That's the PCI-ISA bridge (Intel Saturn I/O ("sio") -- device 8086, heh heh).
It does indeed have no irq line and it is not weird.  Someday maybe someone
will fix this message.

|  This happens whether I set the jumpers on the modem to addr of COM1 or
| COM2, and IRQ 3, 5, or 6.
!
